  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sbt/sbt/tarball/v2.0.11",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sbt/sbt/zipball/v2.0.11",
  "body": "## 🐛 bug fixes\r\n\r\n- fix: Fix AccessDeniedException writing SemanticDB by @eed3si9n in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9878\r\n- fix: Fixes `.m2/settings.xml` overriding sbtResolvers by @eed3si9n in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9828\r\n- fix: Keep accepting after a client fails by @kitbellew in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9691\r\n- fix: Fix task output lost by the thin client under CPU load by @eed3si9n in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9868\r\n- fix: Read all forked test output before reporting the fork's exit by @eugkhp in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9860\r\n- fix: Use Path.userHome to work around `user.home` returning `?` by @eed3si9n in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9866\r\n- fix: Fail a gRPC batch read when a blob fails by @eugkhp in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9904\r\n- fix: Fix pipelined compile hanging when compile inputs fail by @jleider in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9896\r\n- fix: Workaround compiler-interface eviction when depending on the remote cache plugin by @eed3si9n in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9913\r\n- Make logging robust against closed sbtn by @eed3si9n in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9911\r\n- fix: Fix BSP connection getting dropped by @eed3si9n in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9911\r\n\r\n## behind the scenes\r\n\r\n- Update mima setting by @eed3si9n in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9869\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/sbt/sbt/compare/v2.0.10...v2.0.11",
